        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"LicDongleWriteRecord", "[", 
            RowBox[{StyleBox["handle", "TI"], ",", StyleBox["name", "TI"], 
              ",", StyleBox["data", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], 
        " \[LineSeparator]replaces the record name with data."}], "Usage", 
      CellID -> 101716605], Cell["data can be a ByteArray or a String; a \
